  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bemo demonstration two-way vehicle, Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bemo wants to prove to potential customers in Indonesia that it is possible to successfully deploy a two-way vehicle in those conditions.In addition, Bemo wants to convince potential customers of the effectiveness of this technique for shunting yards there. Bemo sees Indonesia as a growth market for rail equipment.Bemo wants to convince the potential customers of the potential of shunting between two tracks as a means of road transport.</narrative>
  </description>
